From 1b437304d54b77d70b430c34ebcb86a85ee84f51 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stephen Kent <43362477+kentstephen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 14:37:31 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Build and run on wasm32-unknown-emscripten (duckdb-wasm)

- Gate zarrs_http (reqwest::blocking) off wasm and route every store
  through DuckDbStore there, so DuckDB's own FileSystem does the I/O.
- Build rayon's global pool with the current thread as its only worker
  at extension init on wasm, so zarrs' parallel iterators run inline.
- -fPIC for C code built by cc-rs (zstd-sys), scoped to the wasm triple:
  duckdb-wasm extensions are emcc side modules.
- DuckDbStore::get_partial_many loops on short reads. duckdb-wasm's HTTP
  filesystem returns 16 KiB pieces.

Native builds are unchanged. The wasm platforms stay in excluded_platforms.
---
 .cargo/config.toml              |  4 ++++
 CHANGELOG.md                    |  6 ++++++
 Cargo.lock                      |  1 +
 Cargo.toml                      | 11 +++++++++++
 docs/design.md                  |  2 +-
 src/lib.rs                      | 10 ++++++++++
 src/zarr_reader/duckdb_store.rs | 24 ++++++++++++++++++++----
 src/zarr_reader/meta.rs         | 18 +++++++++++++++++-
 8 files changed, 70 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/.cargo/config.toml b/.cargo/config.toml
index a1f4f89..1d03f6c 100644
--- a/.cargo/config.toml
+++ b/.cargo/config.toml
@@ -24,3 +24,7 @@ rustflags = []
 
 [env]
 CXXFLAGS_aarch64_apple_darwin = "-isysroot /Library/Developer/CommandLineTools/SDKs/MacOSX.sdk -I/Library/Developer/CommandLineTools/SDKs/MacOSX.sdk/usr/include/c++/v1"
+# duckdb-wasm extensions are emcc side modules, so every object must be PIC.
+# rustc already emits PIC for wasm32-unknown-emscripten; this covers C code built
+# by cc-rs (zstd-sys). Scoped to the wasm triple so native builds are untouched.
+CFLAGS_wasm32_unknown_emscripten = "-fPIC"
diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 5c4304d..0d82ad3 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -6,6 +6,12 @@ The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/).
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+- **WebAssembly build** (`make wasm_mvp`): the extension compiles for `wasm32-unknown-emscripten` and loads in duckdb-wasm. `zarrs_http` (reqwest) is gated off wasm and every store is routed through `DuckDbStore`, so duckdb-wasm's HTTP filesystem does the fetching; rayon's global pool is built with the current thread as its only worker at extension init; C dependencies built by cc-rs (zstd-sys) get `-fPIC` for the wasm triple only. Native builds are unchanged. The wasm platforms remain in `excluded_platforms`.
+
+### Fixed
+- `DuckDbStore::get_partial_many` loops on short reads instead of failing. DuckDB file systems may return fewer bytes than requested (duckdb-wasm's HTTP filesystem returns 16 KiB pieces).
+
 ## [0.1.3] - 2026-08-04
 
 ### Changed
